  "description": "The operating-system-twin native memory tier for Lumoin.Base: MemoryProtectionBacking implements the NativeBackingAllocator seam so BaseMemoryPool serves AllocationKind.Native rents as page-aligned allocations locked into physical memory (VirtualLock on Windows, mlock plus MADV_DONTDUMP on Linux and Android, mlock on Apple platforms) and zeroed on free. Pure P/Invoke into libraries every supported OS already ships - no native assets, no third-party dependencies.",
